# Normalize line endings across platforms. · 跨平台统一行尾。
#
# Store text as LF in the repository; check it out as LF everywhere so the three
# platform CI jobs (and `cargo fmt --check`) see byte-identical sources.
# 仓库内统一存 LF，检出一律 LF，让三平台 CI 与 `cargo fmt --check` 看到完全一致的字节。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only helpers still need CRLF to be usable in Notepad-era tooling.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be touched. · 二进制资源不做任何转换。
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary

# Keep diffs readable for generated files. · 生成物在 diff 中折叠。
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
